{
 "koral-function": 1,
 "purpose": "Post",
 "description": "A picture of light graded to the display: exposed (times `exposure`), white balanced (`temperature`, `tint`, -1 to 1), its `contrast` and `saturation` set (1 as it is), through a `curve` (0 the engine's ACES fit, 1 PBR Neutral, 2 AgX, 3 Reinhard's, 4 Hable's, 5 Lottes's), then lifted, gammaed and gained. `shown` is an RGBA8 picture of it, as the display takes it: what Tonemap would give, graded.",
 "tags": [
  "grade",
  "color grading",
  "tonemap",
  "agx",
  "white balance",
  "contrast",
  "saturation",
  "lift gamma gain",
  "post"
 ],
